id: S21
target: src/sello/scalar.nim
desc: geScalarmultCT: per-digit doubling count off-by-one, 'for _ in 0 ..< 4: acc = geP3Double(acc)' -> '0 ..< 3', scaling the accumulator by 8 instead of 16 at each of the 64 digit positions in the uniform interleaved ladder -- computes the wrong multiple for every nonzero scalar. The geScalarmultCT-specific sibling of S14's geScalarmultBase mutant (RFC-004 slice 8b).
====OLD====
      for _ in 0 ..< 4:
        acc = geP3Double(acc)
====NEW====
      for _ in 0 ..< 3:
        acc = geP3Double(acc)
====END====
